J2. S. Peng and S. X.-D. Tan, “GLU3.0:  Fast GPU-based Parallel Sparse LU Factorization for Circuit Simulation”,  IEEE Design and Test (accepted in Feb 2020), pre-print is available at  http://arxiv.org/abs/1908.00204

 
